MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The heat shrink assortment felt like a useful addition to my washers, screws, and other small hardware supplies for occasional repairs.",
    "The wire connector assortments fit that same practical repair interest, although I would wait for an actual wiring job before choosing one."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The large red tubing and compressed-air regulator require specific sizes or equipment that I have not shown a need for.",
    "Disposable gloves, medical tests, inspection tags, and food cups do not follow from my recent interest in fasteners and magnetic hooks; I have no current task requiring them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seemed to treat a broad range of workplace supplies as relevant just because I had bought hardware.",
    "Buying assorted fasteners seemed to be taken as a reason to offer specialized electrical supplies, even though an assortment alone does not make something useful to me."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases point more clearly toward small fastening and hanging supplies than toward medical, food-service, or inspection supplies.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear use: a versatile repair assortment can appeal to me, but specialized parts and additional connector kits need an immediate project."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly understood my interest in practical hardware assortments but stretched it into supplies for tasks and equipment I have not indicated needing."
}
